  <data name="Closing.Intro" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>A month is closed once it is over: the cash sessions must be locked and the differences of the reconciliations justified; the files to invoice and the e-invoices not transmitted are to be confirmed. The journals are then frozen and nothing more can be dated in the month. Only a manager reopens a month, with a reason.</value>
